7. Kimi Development and Testing

Kimi was used extensively during schema development as a testing environment for the resource-card structure.

The schema was subjected to repeated examination and refinement to determine whether the proposed fields could support the information necessary for both people and AI.

The testing helped establish that the schema could function beyond a simple directory record.

The Kimi test results are formally documented in the project repository.

Status: Kimi testing completed and documented.

