Project Position

The Human-Centered Resource Directory Schema is larger than an individual resource directory, scraper, or application.

It is an attempt to define a better way to represent community-resource information:

Human need as the entry point.

Resource information as the foundation.

Operational reality as necessary information.

Accountability as part of the data.

AI navigability as a design requirement.

Federal interoperability as the structural foundation.

The long-term objective is a resource-information standard that works for the person seeking help, the people maintaining the information, and the AI systems increasingly being used to help people find it.
